 "policy": [
  "Truth rows are constant for an edition and append-only. Errata, renumbering and new cycles are new rows linked by clause_lineage.",
  "Intents are short paraphrases written for this library, never quotations of code text.",
  "Every locator, constant and table value starts as needs-verification. Promote to verified only with verified_by and verified_on after checking the adopted text.",
